{"rangerId":"u1631e-sally","abilities":[{"code":"aab221_aTempt","nameEn":"Charm Resistance","descEn":"Rangers with this Ability won't be affected by charm effects.","nameZh":"誘惑抗性","descZh":"持有這個能力的Ranger不會受到誘惑效果影響。","iconUrl":"https://rangers.lerico.net/res/ability_icon/ab221_atempt_icon.png","game":{"code":"aab221_aTempt","actionType":"NONE","aptitudeType":"ANTI_TEMPT","searchType":"SELF","activeOnType":"ALL","activeWhenType":"BATTLE","cond1Type":"SKILLTYPE","cond1Value":"TEMPT","cond2Type":"NONE","cond2Value":"NONE","probability":1,"factorType":"NONE","factorApplyType":"ADD","buffFactorType":"NONE","buffFactor":3,"subBuffFactor":0}},{"code":"aab230_barrier","nameEn":"Skill Barrier","descEn":"Continuously provides a barrier that protects against Skill Damage.\n- The Skill Barrier disappears after blocking Skill Damage 1 time and is reapplied 3 seconds later.\n- The Skill Barrier remains intact when Skill Damage is reduced to 0 through invincibility.\n- Boss, Guardian, and Special Type enemies' Skill Damage cannot be blocked.","nameZh":"技能防護罩","descZh":"讓自己持續獲得抵擋技能傷害的防護罩。\n※技能防護罩在抵擋1次技能傷害後便會消失，3秒後將再次產生。\n※透過無敵效果讓技能傷害變0時，技能防護罩將不會消失。\n※此能力無法抵擋來自魔王、守護者和特殊類型的敵人的技能傷害。","iconUrl":"https://rangers.lerico.net/res/ability_icon/ab230_barrier_icon.png","game":{"code":"aab230_barrier","actionType":"NONE","aptitudeType":"BARRIER","searchType":"SELF","activeOnType":"ALL","activeWhenType":"INSTANT","cond1Type":"SKILLTYPE","cond1Value":"DMG","cond2Type":"NONE","cond2Value":"NONE","probability":1,"factorType":"NONE","factorApplyType":"ADD","buffFactorType":"NONE","buffFactor":1,"subBuffFactor":3}},{"code":"aab601_clone","nameEn":"Spawn Clone","descEn":"Sometimes 1 additional Ranger is produced at no extra cost.","nameZh":"複製分身","descZh":"以一定機率只消耗生產1隻Ranger所需的礦物量就生產出2隻Ranger。","iconUrl":"https://rangers.lerico.net/res/ability_icon/ab213_2generate_icon.png","game":{"code":"aab601_clone","actionType":"CLONE","aptitudeType":"NONE","searchType":"SELF","activeOnType":"ALL","activeWhenTyp